          "header": "🛠️ Issue 1.3: Resolve Test Suite Degradation",
          "content": "**Type:** Issue / Maintenance\n**Description:**\n- Vitest tests pass, but warn: `Missing production credentials. System running in limited observability mode.`\n- Mock dependencies (e.g., `Jenkins`) emit warnings.\n**Tasks:**\n- [ ] Update `vitest.config.ts` (Fixed casting locally, needs permanent implementation).\n- [ ] Setup a local `.env.test` file with mock database credentials for MongoDB and Supabase to remove test warnings."
        },
        {
          "header": "🧠 Epic 2: Autonomous Core Refinement",
          "content": "**Description:** The \"Antigravity\" cognitive loops (evolution, optimization, synthesis) are active but appear to interfere with standard application behavior and generate recursive data structures."
        },
